Z||000008||Shaun41178||04-06-2001||07:51 PM||||Hey Lisa.  Nice job on the calipers.  Looks good.  I was actually going to ask you if you planned on doing that whie you were here in Daytona but forgot too.  Glad you did.  It looks tons better if that was at all possible to begin with.<P>Thanks again for giving me a ride back to beachside after the show.  I didn't have to walk as far from the hotel as to the speedway that day.  Legs were tired at the end of the night though.  I did try getting a hold of Matt but it wouldnt' connect so I left a messege in Chris's room which I left my phone number but you might not have got it.  What time did the dinner end?  You hit 600 north that night or any other club?  I didn't do anything.  I stayed in and rested my feet.  It was great to meet all of you and hang with some Fiero nuts.  Noone in my area with the same enthusiasm for them.  Hehe still dont' have a battery.<P>Don't know if you still might want to buy some performance heads.  I mentioned it on the way back from the show.  I have them for sale in the Mall section.  No pics but you can look over what has been done to them.  But I am telling you nitrous is the way to go babe.  It will really haul then.  Chris will have to try to beat you then with your nitrous engaged.  Look for me online as SHaun41178 if you have AIM as well or AOL or just send me an email at Shaun41178@aol.com if you just want to shoot the breeze.  Later<P>------------------<BR>Shaun 85 GT with nitrous<BR>0-60 in 5.6 seconds<BR><A HREF="http://members.aol.com/Shaun41178" TARGET=_blank>Preferred Performance</A>||||reg||1
